{"hw":"οὖσον","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">οὖσον</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">οὖσον</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">τό</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">ship's tackle, ropes</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lyc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">20</span> </span> (pl.), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Alex.Aet.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.21</span> </span>, pl. prob. in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Antim.</span> </span> Col.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6</span> </span> (<span class=\"gk\">οἶσον</span> is similarly glossed in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hsch.</span> </span>).</div></div>"}